    "sentence_translations": [
      "Hard working Chinese people",
      "",
      "Paul: You Chinese people are really hard working.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Why do say that?",
      "",
      "Paul: When I went out this morning, I saw some signs beside the road with two big characters: “Zao Dian”.",
      "The signs were reminding people to go to work early and don’t be late.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Haha, this “Zao Dian” means breakfast.",
      "The signs you saw were from restaurants. It means that they sell breakfast in those restaurants.",
      "",
      "Paul: Ok… Let’s go to have breakfast there tomorrow.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Ok, we need to go early. The breakfast will be sold out very quick.",
      ""
    ]
  }
